extends Node3D
## Sparse-island discovery content.  All roots are named Prop_POI_* so the
## existing regrounding pass and audit include them; collision is generated by
## map._add_prop_collision.  The landmarks are deliberately tall and saturated:
## red tent/banner, pale beacon with cyan flame, marble shrine/ruins.

